{#
  The one way this site says "there is nothing here yet" (design.md §7.7).

  An empty state is the first screen every freshly-installed unit sees —
  no articles, no albums, no movements — which made its divergence the
  most visible one on the site: ~100 hand-rolled "Aucun…" paragraphs in
  five different dressings (italic-left, centered, alert-info, table
  cell, plain), of which six offered the reader anything to do next.
  Rendered identically everywhere, an empty state reads as a state; each
  one styled differently reads as a rendering defect.

  Usage:
  {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
      message: 'Aucune actualité pour le moment.',
      action_label: 'Nouvel article',       -- optional, with action_url
      action_url: '/news/new',              -- optional; renders a button
      icon: 'bi-newspaper',                 -- optional decorative icon
      compact: true,                        -- optional: one italic line,
                                            -- for inside cards/lists
      colspan: 5,                           -- optional: renders a whole
                                            -- <tr><td colspan> table row
  } only %}

  Offer the action whenever the visitor has the right to create the
  missing thing ("Créez le premier album !") — the caller decides, since
  only it knows the visitor's rights. The variant without an action is
  for visitors who genuinely cannot act, never a default.

  `compact` is the in-flow variant (a card body, a list tail): a single
  muted italic line, no vertical padding block. `colspan` wraps the whole
  thing in a table row so the two views of a dual table/card page can
  share one declaration.
#}
{% set _inner %}
    {% if compact|default(false) %}
        <p class="text-body-secondary fst-italic mb-0">{{ message }}</p>
        {% if action_label|default('') and action_url|default('') %}
            <a href="{{ action_url }}" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary mt-2">
                {% if icon|default('') %}<i class="bi {{ icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i> {% endif %}{{ action_label }}
            </a>
        {% endif %}
    {% else %}
        <div class="text-center text-body-secondary py-5 empty-state">
            {% if icon|default('') %}
                <i class="bi {{ icon }} fs-2 d-block mb-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            {% endif %}
            <p class="mb-0">{{ message }}</p>
            {% if action_label|default('') and action_url|default('') %}
                <a href="{{ action_url }}" class="btn btn-primary mt-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ action_label }}
                </a>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    {% endif %}
{% endset %}
{% if colspan|default(0) > 0 %}
    <tr><td colspan="{{ colspan }}">{{ _inner }}</td></tr>
{% else %}
    {{ _inner }}
{% endif %}
